# What not to ship to Vercel.
#
# The CLI uploads the working directory, which on this machine also holds the
# camera originals and the loose drop-folders sitting beside the project —
# several hundred megabytes that have no business in a deploy. The published
# photographs live in Blob storage and reach the site through
# src/config/photos.json, so none of these folders are needed to build.

# Camera originals and the web copies generated from them.
/Gallery
/public/gallery
/public/wide

# Loose drop-folders of originals. Some of these names end in a space.
/main photos for wedding*
/new food photos*
/new food pictures*
/photos for food*

# Stray originals and design files kept next to the project.
*.heic
*.HEIC
*.m4v
*.pdf
/ME.png

# Local booking data left over from before the form was removed.
/data

# Build output and local environment.
/.next
/out
.env*
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
